Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.46,0:00:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bernard!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:08.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,MR. BERNARD!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.13,0:00:10.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where's Teach?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.38,0:00:11.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to get him here, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.13,0:00:14.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The boss won't be coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:19.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is a battle we have to win on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.71,0:00:24.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:29.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:30.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's going to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.71,0:00:33.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You just said that Klaus wasn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.71,0:00:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What did you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:36.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Exactly what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:38.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, that's what's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.54,0:00:40.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:43.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach came and visited us all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:45.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was Grete in disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.54,0:00:50.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All those times we saw Teach, it was always just Grete.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:53.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So wait, when we ran into him that one time...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:56.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And that meeting I had...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.25,0:00:58.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.25,0:01:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You didn't just disguise yourself\Nas the assassin with the birthmark,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.83,0:01:03.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but as Teach, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:06.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I memorized the way the boss breathes,\Nthe way he blinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:10.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and the position of every hair on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.83,0:01:12.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn, you're really somethin' else!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I do happen to be plenty good at crossdressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.79,0:01:17.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you still mad about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:22.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In any case, the boss is at\Na different mission site right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.50,0:01:23.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The assassin hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.71,0:01:28.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Corpse was never the one hiding in the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:31.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was his associate, Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.17,0:01:37.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach wants us to capture Olivia\Nwhile he goes and fights Corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.33,0:01:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That about sum it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.17,0:01:40.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:43.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, Teach is all on his own again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.33,0:01:45.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That whole thing about picking four people was a lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.63,0:01:46.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was no lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.58,0:01:49.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He picked four people just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.13,0:01:52.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thea, Monika, Annette, Erna:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.96,0:01:56.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those were the four he took with him to go kill Corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.71,0:02:00.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're the team members who got left out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.21,0:02:02.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We didn't make the cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:04.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.96,0:02:08.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:11.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I left Grete with a message to pass along to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.42,0:02:14.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for tricking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.29,0:02:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Making the enemy spy lurking in the mansion\Nthink that I was close at hand
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.38,0:02:22.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,was the best way I had of protecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With any luck, it should have held them in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.75,0:02:31.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Also, there was a very specific reason
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:31.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Embrace the toll of pain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't bring you along.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:39.29,Song,,0,0,0,,The scabs that will never fade
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:36.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The four of you are incredibly skilled
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:38.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,at working together with your teammates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.50,0:02:44.88,Song,,0,0,0,,That day, a forceful draft snatched it away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:42.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I realized that you were the only ones I could count on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.25,0:02:44.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to fight without me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.88,0:02:49.50,Song,,0,0,0,,Unable to change, I have to leave it behind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.25,0:02:48.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go beat your opponent without relying on my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:49.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm confident you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.79,0:02:54.71,Song,,0,0,0,,Come, outrace your fear
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:53.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The message ends there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:55.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.71,0:02:58.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Face the unfamiliar sky and day on your own two feet
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.04,0:02:57.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For once, there wasn't a single "I just did" in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.83,0:03:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can tell just how much he wanted to encourage us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.08,0:03:00.92,Song,,0,0,0,,And greet the sunrise
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:02.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leave the planning to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.38,0:03:03.96,Song,,0,0,0,,Misfortune gave rise to happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:06.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let that woman get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:06.71,Song,,0,0,0,,You saw a guidepost at the end of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.13,0:03:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.71,0:03:12.04,Song,,0,0,0,,And now, it's lit with a single flame
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:09.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily and I'll go after Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.42,0:03:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you need, Mr. Johnny can track her scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:14.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Shake off the entangled past
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:17.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's as much as I can really help right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:22.38,Song,,0,0,0,,And fight until you find a place your heart can soar
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.63,0:03:20.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've already done plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.29,0:03:21.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for your little ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.96,0:03:23.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we all woulda died back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.38,0:03:28.33,Song,,0,0,0,,Ah, surviving through each moment
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.21,0:03:28.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go prove ourselves, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:32.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're plenty great on our own, even without Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:39.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The moon that night was full,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:43.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,just like it is tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:48.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I was born in a small country to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.75,0:03:53.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I spent my days as a prostitute\Nout in the backcountry,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:03:56.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,and I always assumed that my life\Nwould end there just like it began.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.17,0:04:08.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.42,0:04:11.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My gun has a silencer, but even so,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it takes a bold spirit to sleep through\Nsomething like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:17.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm going to need you to jump out that window.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You went mad, stole a gun that\None of your johns happened to have,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:24.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and went on a killing spree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:26.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, you jumped to your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.63,0:04:28.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the plot of this little story.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.75,0:04:33.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is what happens when a politician like him\Nchases after too many skirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.83,0:04:37.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But why kill all the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.21,0:04:41.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If a single politician died,\Nit would look like the work of an assassin spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:46.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If a bunch of unrelated people die, though,\Nthey'll write it off as a regular old tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.21,0:04:49.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, hurry up and jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.63,0:04:52.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're lucky, you might even survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.83,0:04:57.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Those eyes of his were so different
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.46,0:04:59.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,than all the uninspired gazes I'd seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.04,0:05:01.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It was like he was a prince from another dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.63,0:05:06.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,They took my frigid body\Nand gave it warmth once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:11.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, take me away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've got a knack for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.96,0:05:31.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Roland was a master assassin feared the world over,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.88,0:05:34.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,and I became his apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:41.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I had days full of slaughter, jaw-dropping wages,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.29,0:05:45.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,and sublime affection from the best assassin around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.29,0:05:50.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I could never have gotten any of that out in the sticks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:56.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a man you need to watch out for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:06:00.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I told you that one of our spies took out Inferno, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, one of its members survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.04,0:06:09.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At the moment, that man is the most\Ndangerous individual in the Din Republic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:17.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bonfire, the Dust King, Ax, Lone, Practical, Crowbar...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:23.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He goes by many names,\Nbut the most common one he uses is Klaus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you run into him, get in touch with me immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:28.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.67,0:06:31.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No spy from a backwater nation like this\Nwould stand a chance against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.04,0:06:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, this man's skills are on par with mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.25,0:06:36.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He could well become my rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:38.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your rival?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:40.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even with how talented you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.96,0:06:58.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Be careful around him, my beloved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.33,0:07:06.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look at that, you survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:10.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pretty sloppy of you not to confirm your kills.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.63,0:07:11.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or what,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:15.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,was there someone you were so scared of you wanted\Nto get away as fast as you possibly could?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:20.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need for us to get the boss involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.21,0:07:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll take you on myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.58,0:07:29.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like that explosion just now\Nmessed your right arm up pretty bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.75,0:07:38.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lotta confidence, comin' from someone\Nwho was so scared of our boss she went running!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:42.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Only because Roland acknowledged\NBonfire's strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.04,0:07:43.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Roland"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:46.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The man you people were calling Corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:48.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never want to hear that ugly name\Nout of your mouth again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.29,0:07:54.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but if you're lookin' for the gun\Nyou had strapped to your thigh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:55.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just nicked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:08.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But my surprise attack was perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:11.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Constantly watching out for hostility\Nis a basic best practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:13.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Didn't Bonfire teach you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.21,0:08:16.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is some impressive poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.92,0:08:19.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See, this is why I hate prodigies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:22.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree, Teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.67,0:08:23.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You fuckin' dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.33,0:08:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can have this one back, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:42.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Why was it those two coming after me\Ninstead of Bonfire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:45.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Was Bonfire never here in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But then, that man I saw...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:52.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,must have been the one member of\Ntheir team who wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:56.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll put you out of your misery, you crazy bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:03.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Sybilla, up and at 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.42,0:09:06.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought I was a goner there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:07.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:09.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That poison puts your body into a\Nstate of suspended animation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:12.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm fine 'cuz of my resistance, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:14.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did we manage to trick her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:16.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup, everything went right according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Olivia headed back to the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:22.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is Grete really gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.63,0:09:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fighting ain't exactly her strong suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:28.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't think there's anything to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.46,0:09:31.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There you go, bein' happy-go-lucky again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.92,0:09:34.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, her resolve's on a whole different level.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.21,0:09:39.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So are her plans, her instructions, her leadership,\Nand the way she props up her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.42,0:09:45.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If Olivia makes it back to the mansion,\NI'll finish her off myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.38,0:09:48.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, it's her job to complete the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.04,0:09:52.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She impersonated Teach himself and\Ntook everything on her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:55.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no way someone with a heart\Nthat strong would ever lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.46,0:09:58.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All we have to do now is believe in her,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.50,0:10:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in our strategist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.54,0:10:04.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go on and do great things, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Win Teach's praise and his love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:24.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:26.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Lily and Sybilla will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.75,0:10:29.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Everything so far is just as I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.29,0:10:33.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But I feel like I'm going to be crushed\Nunder the weight of my own fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.71,0:10:37.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Is this the responsibility the boss has to shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:44.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would it be all right if I made one request?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.38,0:10:51.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once I complete the mission,\Nwould you hold me in your arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:56.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have to mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.54,0:10:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just want something to help me keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:04.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.63,0:11:07.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:11.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When you come back alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:12.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll hug you as tightly as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I won't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:29.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I killed Sybilla and Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.13,0:11:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I kill you too, I'll be able to\Ngo back to my job at the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.88,0:11:36.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.08,0:11:40.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My job's to take information from Uwe\Nand pass it along to Roland.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.46,0:11:43.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to be useful to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.75,0:11:46.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, let's do this.\NTo the death!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.17,0:11:58.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not good enough by half.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.67,0:12:01.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What has Bonfire even been teaching you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.33,0:12:03.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see no reason to answer that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:06.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Has he ever made love to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Roland's made love to me countless times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.38,0:12:13.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's showered me with affection,\Ntaught me new skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.04,0:12:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and given me everything I ever wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.29,0:12:18.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, how unloved you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.25,0:12:20.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's pathetic, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:28.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was you in disguise, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.00,0:12:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That Bonfire I saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, how are planning on using that\Ntalent of yours to take me down?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.88,0:12:40.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.54,0:12:42.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want me to jump?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.88,0:12:45.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're planning on making it look like I killed myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.83,0:12:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That will let me pin the blame\Nfor Lily and Sybilla's deaths on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.79,0:12:51.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now do it, or I shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:57.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lucky you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.00,0:13:00.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once you're dead, your teacher will finally love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:02.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even my death wouldn't be enough for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.38,0:13:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The boss doesn't harbor\Nany special feelings towards me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.58,0:13:09.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've known that for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.21,0:13:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really are pathetic, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But he made me a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.08,0:13:16.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't afford to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:21.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to survive if I want the boss\Nto hold me in his arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.46,0:13:22.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.92,0:13:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the road for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.29,0:13:27.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, hurry up and-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.75,0:13:38.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:40.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't sense any hostility.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.88,0:13:43.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I did, I would have been able to dodge the bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:46.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course you didn't feel any hostility.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.79,0:13:49.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That bullet was meant for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.21,0:13:53.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know you're up there, killer scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.50,0:13:57.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn it, he escaped again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:14:00.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous out here!\NYou need to get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.17,0:14:02.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.63,0:14:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a letdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.04,0:14:07.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Having the target jump to their death?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.29,0:14:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you took Corpse's signature move\Nand used it verbatim.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.42,0:14:14.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess you can only mimic what you were taught.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:18.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Daughter Dearest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.67,0:14:20.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, let's fill this time with laughter and tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:22.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That birthmark...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.25,0:14:28.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The reason I let Uwe see me as the assassin twice
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.13,0:14:30.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,wasn't just to root you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.33,0:14:35.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was so he would fire at this birthmarked face\Nwithout hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.33,0:14:41.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd already made sure that his marksmanship returned\Nas his night blindness abated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.58,0:14:46.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I knew that his bullet, aimed at the assassin,\Nwould come flying straight at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:50.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I had to do was dodge,\Nand a bullet devoid of hostility
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.29,0:14:52.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,would strike you directly as you stood behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:54.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.04,0:14:56.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What part of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.79,0:14:59.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no way you could have\Ndonned a disguise that quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.13,0:15:01.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never gave you a chance to put on a mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:04.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't put on a disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:05.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did the exact opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.67,0:15:07.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I took one off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:10.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Taking off a mask is so easy,\Nyou can do it in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:15.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is my real face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is why nobody ever loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.17,0:15:23.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.38,0:15:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It all makes sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.13,0:15:26.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, that's why you're so needy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.83,0:15:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No wonder you're so unloved!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.04,0:15:31.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See, the thing about women who are loved
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:34.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is that we don't have to fight ourselves because\Nwe have men who protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.54,0:15:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A transmitter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.88,0:15:40.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The moment I saw Bonfire,\NI called Roland in to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.13,0:15:45.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That turned out to just be you in disguise,\Nbut it all worked out for me in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:51.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you kill me, he'll go mad with rage\Nand go on a wild rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.00,0:15:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because he loves me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.54,0:15:54.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This changes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.88,0:15:57.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just as I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.42,0:15:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everything is going how I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.25,0:16:01.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This time, you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can take that hideous, unloved face of yours\Nwith you to the grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:09.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a sorry woman you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.83,0:16:11.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't begin to comprehend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:15.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How can you see her face and not feel anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.92,0:16:18.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bonfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.21,0:16:24.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even now, I can clearly remember\Nthe sight I saw that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.13,0:16:40.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The moment I saw her naked face,\NI understood everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.54,0:16:45.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could tell just how intently she'd built up\Nher techniques in order to obtain love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:48.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could tell how much she'd honed herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.75,0:16:53.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Her face spoke of a radiantly magnificent heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.17,0:16:55.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I found myself enchanted by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:16:58.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I couldn't help but say,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.42,0:17:01.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"How beautiful."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:07.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where's Roland?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.75,0:17:09.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right there in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.33,0:17:13.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Olivia?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.29,0:17:14.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But how?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:16.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You said you were evenly matched with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.63,0:17:17.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Evenly matched?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:20.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That reminds me, I had a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.04,0:17:25.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As soon as I ran into him, he starting babbling\Nsome nonsense about us being rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:27.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you know what that was about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.25,0:17:28.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:30.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, he was a pushover.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.75,0:17:33.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As the World's Strongest, he was no match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.25,0:17:38.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's lying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.63,0:17:40.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This isn't really happening, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:42.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, Roland, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:44.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Olivia...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.63,0:17:46.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Save me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:52.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, no! Why is this happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.63,0:17:53.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grete...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.71,0:17:55.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On it, I came prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:58.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You two have taken too many lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.42,0:18:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shadow war or not, your actions are unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope you've made your peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.50,0:18:07.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.83,0:18:10.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He never taught me about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.50,0:18:11.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.71,0:18:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now I understand why you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.83,0:18:23.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You people aren't qualified to be our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.46,0:18:32.92,Song-2,,0,0,0,,I've been watching the night as it pours on down
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:35.58,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Even as it gets closer and closer
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:37.83,Song-2,,0,0,0,,(Give it up, give it up)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.17,0:18:41.79,Song-2,,0,0,0,,If I quietly gave you my secret name
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.79,0:18:47.46,Song-2,,0,0,0,,I could vanish into the dark to avoid being found
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:58.67,Song-2,,0,0,0,,I've forgotten all about those secret tears I shed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:19:02.17,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Like my cells all got replaced
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.17,0:19:04.54,Song-2,,0,0,0,,I'm a different person now
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.88,0:19:08.29,Song-2,,0,0,0,,So let's frolic our way through these busy days
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.29,0:19:11.08,Song-2,,0,0,0,,I kind of want to talk to you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.08,0:19:13.33,Song-2,,0,0,0,,But everyone is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.33,0:19:17.08,Song-2,,0,0,0,,That's not what it means
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.08,0:19:20.54,Song-2,,0,0,0,,To make someone a promise
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.58,0:19:26.13,Song-2,,0,0,0,,I've been watching the night as it pours on down
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.13,0:19:28.96,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Even as it gets closer and closer
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.96,0:19:31.21,Song-2,,0,0,0,,(Give it up, give it up)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:35.13,Song-2,,0,0,0,,If I quietly gave you my secret name
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.13,0:19:40.29,Song-2,,0,0,0,,I could vanish into the dark to avoid being found
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.29,0:19:41.75,Song-2,,0,0,0,,And when we're born again
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.75,0:19:44.08,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Flying through a new night sky
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:48.71,Song-2,,0,0,0,,We intersect again and again
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:50.38,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Standing on level stars
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.38,0:19:52.92,Song-2,,0,0,0,,And gazing straight into each other's eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:57.63,Song-2,,0,0,0,,I want to give it to you when we meet again
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.50,0:20:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The mission's finally over,\Nso let's end it by going for a drive together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.08,0:20:07.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I do believe it was Lily who made that suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.13,0:20:09.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.79,0:20:12.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That girl lies as easily as she breathes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.29,0:20:18.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my bold scheme,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:22.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grete's probably sobbing with gratitude\Nright about now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:24.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you think she's actually crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.67,0:20:26.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hell if I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.13,0:20:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, she worked her ass off this time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:33.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd say she's earned this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.17,0:20:49.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grete, I've done a lot of thinking over this past month.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:57.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was trying to figure out what the best way for me\Nto respond to your love would be,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:21:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,both as your boss, as the Greatest Spy\Nin the World, and as a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.42,0:21:04.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Were you able to reach a conclusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.50,0:21:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.58,0:21:19.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I decided to ignore all my ideals,\Nresponsibilities, and pretenses
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.75,0:21:22.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and tell you how I truly felt as a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:29.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grete, I hold no romantic attraction towards you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.50,0:21:32.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't return your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.83,0:21:34.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.75,0:21:38.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, I don't want you to misunderstand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.29,0:21:43.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've never felt romantic attraction towards anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.58,0:21:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Romantic love isn't what I'm looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.71,0:21:50.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What I want is familial love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.33,0:21:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The kind of bonds that form over the course of both\Nharsh missions and peaceful downtimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.75,0:22:03.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I can't return your romantic love.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.67,0:22:05.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't love you as a woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.79,0:22:08.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and if you end up developing feelings\Nfor some other man,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.75,0:22:10.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then I'll have no right to get in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.79,0:22:16.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But if you're willing to stay by my side,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.21,0:22:20.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then I would like very much to love you\Nas a member of my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.58,0:22:25.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.42,0:22:56.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.88,0:23:01.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me how you see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.67,0:23:05.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing I possibly could say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.33,0:23:13.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grete, you're beautiful.
